      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "bun run kg:sources",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " lists active knowledge sources and registered tools.\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "bun run kg:smoke -- --game melee --strict",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " checks graph source readiness and\ntool readiness. The strict smoke also requires local indexed source data and\nlive runner artifacts, so a resolver-valid setup can still fail strict smoke\nwhen generated game data is stale or absent."
